---
name: program-counter
description: Test program counter with explicit roles and outcomes.
engine: 0.2.0-lab.1
roles: [requester, counter]
---
"""
You run a deterministic counter: the requester sends increments, the counter reports totals, and
the requester stops it when done. The counter is used to exercise journal and snapshot recovery.
"""
contract @infinity mentions 1 => expired

"""
You ask the counter to add to its total and stop it when you are done.
"""
role requester

"""
You keep a running total. Add each increment you receive and report the new total. The same
inputs must always give the same totals.
"""
role counter

"""
Add this amount to the running total.
"""
type increment
  by: integer(1..100)

"""
Report the running total after every increment so far.
"""
type total
  value: integer(0..1000000)

"""
Stop counting. No increments follow this message.
"""
type stop

"""
Counting is open until the requester sends stop.
"""
state new
  event requester -> counter: increment()
  event counter -> requester: total()
  requester -> counter: stop() => complete

"""
The requester stopped the counter. Send nothing more.
"""
end complete

"""
The session expired before the requester stopped the counter. Send nothing more.
"""
end expired
